OL,3,CSix people deny wrongdoing over
OL,4,Calleged drone factory break-in
OL,6,FSix people have denied wrongdoing
OL,7,Fafter allegedly breaking into a drone
OL,8,Ffactory owned by Israel-based defence
OL,9,Fcompany Elbit Systems UK.
OL,11,FUAV Tactical Systems in Braunstone,
OL,12,Fnear Leicester, was targeted on 24
OL,13,FApril.
OL,15,FA video posted on social media
OL,16,Fafterwards claimed a group called
OL,17,FPeople Against Genocide was
OL,18,Fresponsible for the damage, a court
OL,19,Fwas told.
