OL,3,CSix people deny wrongdoing over
OL,4,Calleged drone factory break-in
OL,6,FSix people appeared before Leicester
OL,7,FCrown Court on Friday:
OL,9,FAll six denied burglary and damaging
OL,10,Fproperty valued at more than #5,000.
OL,12,FA hearing at the Old Bailey in London
OL,13,Fin May was told the company was
OL,14,Ftargeted because of its "perceived
OL,15,Flinks to Elbit Systems UK and supply
OL,16,Fof arms and component parts used by
OL,17,FIsrael in attacks on Palestine".
OL,26,@vD@YOUyD@_O]
