OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786117692
OL,3,CSix people deny wrongdoing over
OL,4,Calleged drone factory break-in
OL,6,FAt Friday's hearing, Judge Timothy
OL,7,FSpencer KC said he would allow six
OL,8,Fweeks for the trial, which is set for
OL,9,FMay 17 in Leicester.
OL,11,FA further hearing was scheduled for 10
OL,12,FDecember.
OL,14,FJones, Hockney and Kennard were
OL,15,Fallowed to leave court on conditional
OL,16,Fbail, while Davies, Sackur and Rivers
OL,17,Fwere told they must stay in custody.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/4
