PN,34404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786117692
OL,3,CSix people deny wrongdoing over
OL,4,Calleged drone factory break-in
OL,6,FJudge Spencer told the defendants:
OL,7,F"What really matters to you is that
OL,8,Fthere will be a further hearing on 10
OL,9,FDecember and you will stand trial here
OL,10,Fon 17 May.
OL,12,F"Those of you in custody must go back
OL,13,Fdown now and those on bail stay on
OL,14,Fbail.
OL,16,F"Continue to observe your bail
OL,17,Fconditions and you are free to go."
